# Rights and provenance

Original Prism Tide source and test code, visual design, native assets, screenshots, video and synthesized audio (where present): rights reserved. No new MIT, Creative Commons or other license grant is made for this case.

The repository's existing site-code MIT license remains separate. Third-party software licenses remain unchanged.

No third-party image, texture, model, music or font file is included. The project uses Godot's built-in fallback font at runtime. Godot is MIT licensed; its bundled font notices are distributed with Godot. Godot binaries, MCP addon binaries, and fonts are not redistributed here. Godot: https://godotengine.org/license/

Source is editable GDScript procedural drawing and an original deterministic optical puzzle. It is not a separately modeled scene hierarchy. Neither the Godot nor DCC-MCP marks imply endorsement. Model and reasoning effort: Unknown for every stage.
